{"ref":"BDB, צוּד","hw":"צוּד","html":"† I. <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">צוּד</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. hunt (</strong>NH id. (rare), <span dir=\"rtl\">מְצוּדָה</span> = BH Assyrian <em>ṣâdu</em>, <em>hunt</em>, so Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">(صيد)</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">صَادَ</span>, Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">צוּד</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צִיד</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">((ܨܘܕ) ܨܳܕ)</span> Old Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">צידא</span> <em>hunting</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">צָד֣וּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:18\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.18\">La 4:18</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">צָדוּנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:52\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.52\">3:52</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וְצָדוּם</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 16:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.16.16\">Je 16:16</a>; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָצוּד</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 17:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.17.13\">Lv 17:13</a>, etc.; Imv. ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">צוּ֫דָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:3\" href=\"/Genesis.27.3\">Gn 27:3</a>; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">צוֹד</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:52\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.52\">La 3:52</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לָצוּד</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:5\" href=\"/Genesis.27.5\">Gn 27:5</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַצָּד</span> v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:33\" href=\"/Genesis.27.33\">33</a>;—<em>hunt</em>, c. acc. i. <span dir=\"rtl\">צַיִד</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:3\" href=\"/Genesis.27.3\">Gn 27:3</a> Qr (> Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">צידה</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:5\" href=\"/Genesis.27.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:33\" href=\"/Genesis.27.33\">33</a> (all J), <span dir=\"rtl\">צֵיד חַיָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 17:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.17.13\">Lv 17:13</a> (H); <span dir=\"rtl\">טֶרֶף</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 38:39\" href=\"/Job.38.39\">Jb 38:39</a>; c. acc. pers. <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:2\" href=\"/Micah.7.2\">Mi 7:2</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵרֶם</span>, instr.), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 16:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.16.16\">Je 16:16</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵעַל</span>), <a data-ref=\"Job 10:16\" href=\"/Job.10.16\">Jb 10:16</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צוֹד צָדוּנִי כַצִּפּוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:52\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.52\">La 3:52</a>, subj. evil <a data-ref=\"Psalms 140:12\" href=\"/Psalms.140.12\">ψ 140:12</a>; c. acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">צְעָדֵינוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:18\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.18\">La 4:18</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶפֶשׁ יְקָרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:26\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.26\">Pr 6:26</a>.—<a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:13\" href=\"/Hosea.9.13\">Ho 9:13</a> read prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">לָצוּד</span> (or <span dir=\"rtl\">לָצַיִד</span>), for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">לְצוֹר</span>, v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, צֹר²\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_צֹר²\">צֹר</a>. <strong>Pōʿl.</strong> <em>hunt</em> (Keenly, eagerly?), Impf. 2 fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּצוֹדֵדְנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.18\">Ez 13:18</a>; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְצוֹדֵד</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.18\">18</a>; Pt. fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְצֹדְדוֹת</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.20\">20</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, all c. acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְפָשׁוֹת</span> (of magic arts, necromancy, etc.).","next":"BDB, צַ֫יִד","prev":"BDB, צוֹבָא"}